# Architecture

## What it is
A pure-Python library (\`src/wordcount/__init__.py\`). It counts words and lists the most common ones.

## Components
| Component | Role | Where |
|---|---|---|
| \`count_words\` | number of whitespace-separated words | \`src/wordcount/__init__.py\` |
| \`top_words\` | n most common lower-cased words, ties alphabetical | \`src/wordcount/__init__.py\` |

## External dependencies
None at run time. Tests use pytest.
X
