# Disposable instance

A library has no running instance. Drive it in a throwaway interpreter:

| Step | Command | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Start | \`PYTHONPATH=src python3\` | synthetic text only |
| Drive | \`>>> import wordcount; wordcount.top_words("b a b")\` | |
| Tear down | exit the interpreter | leaves nothing behind |
X
