# verify

1. Run the gate: \`python3 scripts/check.py\`. Keep its output.
2. Drive the changed function in a throwaway interpreter, as docs/disposable-instance.md says,
   on synthetic text. Record the call and its result.
3. Put the evidence in the change description\x27s \`## Proof\` table, one row per acceptance
   criterion. Say what you could not drive under \`### Not verified\`.
X
